    "heading_2": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "jcr:title": "Empowering Efficient Innovation",
     "type": "h2",
     "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
    },
    "textwithimage": {
     "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
     "fileReference": "/content/dam/macnicaglobal2/americas/mai/en/images/service/macnica sign jp.jpg",
     "imageRatio": "40",
     "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "bruno.jaques@macnicadhw.com.br",
     "alt": "macnica building",
     "text": "<p>Macnica Americas is a solutions company that partners with innovators to bring advanced technology products from concept to market. As the North American division of Macnica Holdings, Inc. - a $10B global leader headquartered in Yokohama, Japan - we deliver more than just components. We provide deep technical expertise, engineering services, and proprietary technologies to help customers design, develop, and deploy differentiated solutions.</p>\r\n<p>Our core strength lies in supporting OEMs across key verticals such as Automotive &amp; Mobility, ProAV &amp; Broadcast, Industrial, and Imaging. From early architecture through to full production, our engineering teams collaborate closely with customers to solve design challenges, accelerate development cycles, and deliver purpose-built systems that optimize performance, scalability, and cost.</p>\r\n<p>With a rich portfolio that includes IP cores, video transport and compression technologies, FPGA expertise, sensor integration, and display customization, Macnica Americas transforms complex requirements into tailored, production-ready solutions. Our Automotive Division further extends this capability with specialized support for vehicle networking, autonomous systems, and in-cabin technologies.</p>\r\n<p>Part of a globally integrated network, Macnica Americas enables customers to access world-class innovation and logistics - locally and internationally. We are headquartered in San Diego, with regional offices and representatives across North America to provide high-touch, high-impact service wherever it's needed.</p>\r\n<p>Macnica Americas: Engineering Tomorrow’s Technology, Today.</p>\r\n",
     "displayPopupTitle": "true",
     "linkTarget": "_self",
     "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 22 2026 22:01:35 GMT+0000",
