       "heading_3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:title": "Delivering Quality to You One Box at a Time",
        "type": "h2",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/title"
       },
       "text_3": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "text": "<p>As a leading global technology services distributor, Macnica Group takes pride in providing logistics services with quality and agility.</p>\n<p>Macnica&nbsp;Group franchises with more than 200 worldwide suppliers as the primary authorized distributor to serve customers large and small in the Americas, Europe, and Asia Pacific countries.</p>\n<p>Macnica Americas has a distribution warehouse in California with an ISO9001:2015 certified QMS system and uses third-party logistics (3PL) warehouse in Huntsville, AL with an ISO9001:2015 certified QMS system for automotive customers.</p>",
        "sling:resourceType": "macnicaglobal2/components/content/text",
        "textIsRich": "true"
       }
      }
     },
